。今吾因國家之資，藉戰勝之威，則何往而不克哉！」\n\n三月，恪大發州郡二十萬眾復入寇，以滕胤為都下督，掌統留事。夏，四月，大赦","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-2c82a01528a1f448","query":"曹芳","count":1,"offset":3191,"excerpt":"曰：「非君，此橋不立。」對曰：「非陛下之明，臣亦無所施其巧。」\n\n是歲，邵陵厲公曹芳卒。初，芳之廢遷金墉也，太宰中郎陳留范粲素服拜送，哀動左右。遂稱疾不出，陽狂不言，寢所乘車，足不履地。子孫有婚宦大事，輒密諮焉，合者則色無變，不合則眠寢不安，妻","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":3,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:weishu-77c7f429ddf701e2","bookId":"book:weishu","requestedTitle":"魏書/卷108之二","title":"魏書/卷108之二","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7108%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8C","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=467997","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7108%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8C?action=history","revisionId":467997,"revisionTimestamp":"2016-07-13T16:29:16Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:48:03.748Z","sha256":"33e36038612a38f9362cf10344d5056de3cb7ab79d99bb14872b58e6ce0252f0","textSha256":"784fb2c79a132a31a4cf4071e98187d36a3edcd905144092dfaa04f33903588c","expandedWikitextSha256":"33e36038612a38f9362cf10344d5056de3cb7ab79d99bb14872b58e6ce0252f0","characters":8694,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/weishu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.588Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334